Fix building with Boost 1.87 - 1.90.

- Boost 1.87 removed asio::io_service, use io_context and asio::post().
- Boost 1.87 dropped resolver results -> endpoint conversion in
  async_connect, use the range overload.
- Boost 1.88 made Boost.Process v2 the default, keep using the v1 API.
- Boost 1.89 no longer ships a Boost::system component (header-only since
  1.69).

Rebased for 3.0 from the ::gentoo boost-1.87/1.88/1.89 patches.

